WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.361 --> 00:00:16.162
hope that monkey finds a lot of food," said Bajie.

2
00:00:16.182 --> 00:00:17.642
"I'm hungry."

3
00:00:18.943 --> 00:00:20.824
Tang Monk shivered and hugged himself.

4
00:00:20.844 --> 00:00:23.365
"I'm so cold," he said.

5
00:00:24.245 --> 00:00:27.807
He looked up at the monastery again and then back at his companions.

6
00:00:27.827 --> 00:00:31.168
"Do you two believe there are demons up there?"

7
00:00:32.756 --> 00:00:34.497
Wujing stroked his chin.

8
00:00:35.478 --> 00:00:36.198
not sure.

9
00:00:36.959 --> 00:00:38.400
Wukong believed it though."

10
00:00:39.880 --> 00:00:41.101
Bajie snorted.

11
00:00:41.121 --> 00:00:43.222
"Wukong is too careful.

12
00:00:43.863 --> 00:00:46.084
He's always worried that we'll bump into a demon."

13
00:00:47.025 --> 00:00:48.225
His stomach grumbled.

14
00:00:49.886 --> 00:00:51.107
"I'm starving."

15
00:00:53.409 --> 00:00:55.510
Wujing looked at the monastery again.

16
00:00:55.530 --> 00:00:58.732
"That place looks perfectly safe to me."

17
00:01:01.645 --> 00:01:03.366
nodded. "It looks warm too.

18
00:01:04.247 --> 00:01:05.868
Maybe the monks there will take us in."

19
00:01:05.948 --> 00:01:09.831
"It would be nice to get out of this cold," said the Tang Monk.

20
00:01:11.733 --> 00:01:13.134
settles it," said the pig.

21
00:01:13.154 --> 00:01:15.536
"Who cares what that monkey thinks?

22
00:01:16.617 --> 00:01:17.337
does he know?

23
00:01:18.578 --> 00:01:21.581
Let's go up there, get warm, and eat some food."

24
00:01:25.143 --> 00:01:30.568
The Tang Monk climbed back onto the horse, and the three travelers headed toward the monastery.

25
00:01:33.484 --> 00:01:36.186
When they got there, no people were around.

26
00:01:36.206 --> 00:01:39.449
"This place is deserted," said Wujing.

27
00:01:40.890 --> 00:01:43.372
Bajie knocked on the door, but no one answered.

28
00:01:47.256 --> 00:01:48.036
the pig called.

29
00:01:48.056 --> 00:01:50.178
"Is anybody in there?"

30
00:01:51.820 --> 00:01:53.121
Again there was no answer.

31
00:01:54.962 --> 00:01:56.243
looked at his companions.

32
00:01:56.263 --> 00:01:58.525
"Maybe the monks didn't hear me."

33
00:02:00.727 --> 00:02:01.047
eyes lit up.

34
00:02:02.600 --> 00:02:04.622
"Maybe they're all in the kitchen, cooking food!

35
00:02:05.882 --> 00:02:10.306
With noodles boiling and vegetables sizzling, a kitchen can be quite noisy."

36
00:02:11.386 --> 00:02:13.168
pig's stomach growled again.

37
00:02:13.188 --> 00:02:16.970
"I'll go in and find out."

38
00:02:18.211 --> 00:02:20.113
opened the door and stepped inside.

39
00:02:21.413 --> 00:02:23.595
The monastery was dark and silent.

40
00:02:24.876 --> 00:02:27.798
"I don't hear anyone cooking," Bajie said to himself.

41
00:02:27.818 --> 00:02:30.280
"Maybe there isn't anyone here."

42
00:02:31.552 --> 00:02:34.714
He walked down a long hallway, past several dark rooms.

43
00:02:34.734 --> 00:02:39.256
"Hello?" he called again.

44
00:02:41.197 --> 00:02:42.858
he saw a room that was lit up.

45
00:02:43.639 --> 00:02:44.639
He went inside.

46
00:02:45.640 --> 00:02:48.922
Bright sunlight was streaming through a window and onto a table.

47
00:02:50.062 --> 00:02:52.984
On the table were three silk vests.

48
00:02:54.345 --> 00:02:57.606
"Those vests look magnificent," said the pig.

49
00:02:58.587 --> 00:03:00.368
shivered. "They also look warm."

50
00:03:01.464 --> 00:03:02.244
He looked around.

51
00:03:04.505 --> 00:03:07.306
Then he grabbed the vests and hurried back outside.

52
00:03:07.326 --> 00:03:12.347
"Nobody's in there," he said to the monk and Wujing.

53
00:03:12.367 --> 00:03:14.468
"But I found these vests."

54
00:03:14.488 --> 00:03:17.529
"Great!" Wujing grabbed a vest.

55
00:03:17.549 --> 00:03:19.029
"I'm freezing."

56
00:03:20.670 --> 00:03:22.310
handed a vest to the Tang Monk.

57
00:03:23.010 --> 00:03:24.010
"Here you go, Master."

58
00:03:25.071 --> 00:03:25.871
monk frowned.

59
00:03:25.891 --> 00:03:26.991
"I won't wear that.

60
00:03:27.631 --> 00:03:30.220
You stole it!"

61
00:03:30.560 --> 00:03:32.362
didn't steal it," said Bajie.

62
00:03:32.382 --> 00:03:35.444
"I borrowed it."

63
00:03:36.806 --> 00:03:37.886
monk glared at him.

64
00:03:37.906 --> 00:03:40.649
"You must return those vests right away!"

65
00:03:41.509 --> 00:03:44.872
"We can return the vests before we leave," offered Wujing.

66
00:03:44.892 --> 00:03:46.273
"Right, Bajie?"

67
00:03:46.293 --> 00:03:49.976
"Oh, um, sure," said the pig.

68
00:03:49.996 --> 00:03:51.378
"We can do that."

69
00:03:53.139 --> 00:03:55.401
"You two are terrible," said the Tang Monk.

70
00:03:55.421 --> 00:03:58.744
"We'll never get the True Scriptures from Buddha if you steal."

71
00:04:01.125 --> 00:04:04.167
shrugged. "Master, you don't have to wear your vest.

72
00:04:05.007 --> 00:04:06.228
But I'm cold."

73
00:04:07.549 --> 00:04:09.391
put his arm through the armhole.

74
00:04:10.411 --> 00:04:11.572
Wujing did the same.

75
00:04:12.733 --> 00:04:13.874
put his other arm through.

76
00:04:14.914 --> 00:04:17.036
Wujing began buttoning his vest.

77
00:04:19.418 --> 00:04:21.059
Suddenly they both cried out.

78
00:04:21.079 --> 00:04:23.501
"It's tight!"

79
00:04:23.761 --> 00:04:24.622
cried Bajie.

80
00:04:24.642 --> 00:04:26.583
"I can't breathe!"

81
00:04:26.883 --> 00:04:28.824
cried Wujing.

82
00:04:28.844 --> 00:04:32.486
They both fell to the ground, trying desperately to take the vests off.

83
00:04:32.506 --> 00:04:35.147
"This vest won't come off!"

84
00:04:35.388 --> 00:04:36.068
cried the pig.

85
00:04:36.088 --> 00:04:38.569
"Who stole my vests?"

86
00:04:39.090 --> 00:04:39.970
a voice shouted.

87
00:04:41.091 --> 00:04:43.452
A demon with one big horn rushed over.

88
00:04:45.853 --> 00:04:49.215
He looked at Bajie and Wujing, and then turned to the Tang Monk.

89
00:04:49.235 --> 00:04:51.096
"Who are you?"

90
00:04:51.496 --> 00:04:52.577
demanded the demon.

91
00:04:52.597 --> 00:04:58.180
"I-I'm from the Tang Empire," said the monk, shaking with fear.

92
00:04:59.212 --> 00:05:04.540
"I'm traveling to the West for—" demon clasped his hands together.

